msgid "{doc}`GettingStarted`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Contributing.md:181
msgid ""
"Discusses how to get up and running quickly with the LLVM infrastructure. "
"Everything from unpacking and compilation of the distribution to execution "
"of some tools."
msgstr ""

